,"poem":2},{"noteId":85},{"text":"som unga vildoxar.","poem":3}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"Herrens röst klyver luften","poem":1},{"text":"med flammande eld,","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"Herrens röst får öknen att bäva,","poem":1},{"text":"Herren får Kadesh öken","poem":2},{"noteId":86},{"text":"att bäva.","poem":3}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"Herrens röst får hindar att föda","poem":1},{"noteId":87},{"text":"och rycker bort skogarnas kläder.","poem":3},{"text":"Allt i hans tempel","poem":2},{"text":"förkunnar hans ära.","poem":3}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"Herren tronade","poem":1},{"text":"när syndafloden kom,","poem":3},{"text":"Herren tronar som kung för evigt.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"Herren ger styrka åt sitt folk,","poem":1},{"text":"Herren välsignar sitt folk","poem":2},{"text":"med frid.","poem":3}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":85,"caller":"-","text":"SirjonBerget Hermons namn bland sidonierna (se 5 Mos 3:9).","reference":{"chapter":29,"verse":6}},{"noteId":86,"caller":"-","text":"Kadesh ökenAntingen Kadesh-Barnea nära Sinai (4 Mos 20:1, 5 Mos 1:19) eller det nordliga Kedesh nära Libanon (Dom 4:6, jfr vers 5-6). \"Öken\" kan också översättas \"ödemark\" (jfr 65:13).","reference":{"chapter":29,"verse":8}},{"noteId":87,"caller":"-","text":"får hindar att födaAnnan översättning: \"får ekar att darra\".","reference":{"chapter":29,"verse":9}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/swe_fol/PSA/29.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/swe_fol/PSA/30.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/swe_fol/PSA/28.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}